# Dependencies are installed inside the image. `**/` matters: a bare
# `node_modules` only excludes the ROOT one, so the host's apps/*/node_modules
# (Windows/macOS native binaries, absolute symlinks) were being copied over the
# Linux install.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

.git
.github
.husky
.tmp-phase9
.env*
**/.env*
*.md
docs
e2e

# The API image needs only the web app's manifest (for the frozen lockfile).
apps/web/*
!apps/web/package.json
